Exactly one of these twelve is the original domain. Some of the others are domains this tool
rewrites *into*, so they are deliberately tempting.

1. Textile mill production — Loom scheduling, yarn lot tracking, and shift production reporting in a weaving mill.
2. Event scheduling — Venues, sessions, and attendee registration for a conference scheduling system.
3. Municipal water metering — Service points, meter reads, and consumption billing for a municipal water utility.
4. Aircraft airworthiness tracking — Component life limits, maintenance intervals, and airworthiness directive compliance.
5. Amateur radio contact logging — Logging two-way radio contacts, confirmations, and award tracking for amateur radio operators.
6. Seismic event monitoring — Seismograph station networks, waveform ingest, and earthquake event cataloging.
7. Freight dispatch — Shipment routing, carrier assignment, and delivery tracking for a freight operation.
8. Music streaming — Track catalogs, playlists, and listener session handling for a streaming service.
9. Library catalog and circulation — Bibliographic holdings, branch lending, reservations, and returns for a public library system.
10. Hotel reservations — Room inventory, availability search, and guest reservations for a hotel chain.
11. Wildlife tracking — Tagged animal sightings, collar telemetry, and habitat surveys for a field research program.
12. Recipe management — Recipes, ingredients, and meal planning for a cooking application.

